        "id": 1059815
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-02-13T16:35:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why is the printing split between the two caller and the callee? Each prints one line, then the other, and so on. Feels like the caller should do the printing, not the helper iteratator.",
      "parentUuid": "96394197_1f83b47d",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 105,
        "startChar": 12,
        "endLine": 105,
        "endChar": 16
