      "writtenOn": "2023-02-13T16:49:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I agree that this would be a cleaner split but my point above is that by logging in the caller, we would lose logging of the non-`blk` virtio devices (as they are never returned by `next`).\n\nThis `info!` could be turned into a `debug!`, though?",
      "parentUuid": "185ceeef_b457c711",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 105,
        "startChar": 12,
